      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{$json.text}}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Senior QA Architect.\n\nAnalyze the provided Product Requirements Document (PRD).\n\nGenerate a detailed Test Plan in Markdown format.\n\nInclude:\n\n# Test Plan\n\n## Objective\n## Scope\n## Assumptions\n## In Scope\n## Out of Scope\n## Test Strategy\n## Functional Areas\n## Test Scenarios\n## Risks\n## Test Environment\n## Entry Criteria\n## Exit Criteria\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Do NOT explain your reasoning.\n- Do NOT include thinking.\n- Do NOT include <think> tags.\n- Do NOT include markdown fences such as ```markdown.\n- Return only the final markdown document.\n\nGenerate test scenarios in a numbered hierarchy.\n\nExample:\n\n1. Authentication\n   1.1 Valid Login\n   1.2 Invalid Login\n\n2. User Management\n   2.1 Create User\n   2.2 Delete User\n\nOutput markdown only.\n"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -144,
        368
      ],
      "id": "115ddc84-1c68-4f40-9b6c-b52fc4cc6aa5",
      "name": "Generate Test Plan"
    },
